  "translation": "Na nau, givim ⟨את⟩ dispela maunten long mi, we Yahwe i tok long dispela de; long wanem yu harim long dispela de olsem Anakim ol i stap long en, na ol taun bikpela tru ol i wokim banis; maibe Yahwe i stap wantaim ⟨את⟩ mi, na bai mi drivaunim ol, olsem we Yahwe i tok.",
